      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 06 - Error Monitoring Center\nCentral **Error Workflow** for all your n8n workflows.\n\n1. Any failing workflow (that selects this one as its *Error workflow*) lands here.\n2. The error is normalized, classified (auth, rate limit, server, network, data) and given a severity + fingerprint.\n3. Same error within the dedupe window is logged but **not re-alerted** (no alert storms).\n4. Telegram alert with a fix hint and execution link; **critical** errors also go by email.\n5. Every evening a digest summarizes the last 24h.\n\n**Setup:** fill Config + Digest Config, pick the sheet `n8n Error Log` (tab `Errors`), then in each workflow: Settings → Error workflow → this workflow.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
